"""Long-form article — Best Roof Rack Crossbars for 2021–2026 Chevrolet Tahoe (5th gen, T1).
Mirrors the approved pilot (ford_f150_2021_tonneau.py) and the flush-rail SUV guides (Highlander, Palisade).
No invented hands-on testing: vehicle facts come from etrailer's 2023 Tahoe roof page ("Flush mounted rails that run
front to back"), etrailer's 2021 Tahoe Thule setup (TH711500 + TH710601 + TH95JW, 165 lb feet / 220 lb bars,
$704.85), The Rack Shop's Tahoe Yakima kit ($653.85 sale, 165 lb) and Tahoe Z71 Thule kit (Fit Kit 186117, 165 lb,
58 in max spread, $604.85 sale), Rack Warehouse's Thule Evo Flush Rail page, Chevrolet Accessories part 86558288
(2021–2026 Tahoe/Suburban cross rail package, aluminum, no rating published), Edmunds' 2025 trims page (RST
Performance Edition "Removes roof rack"), Wikipedia's Tahoe page and ASG Auto Sports' BRIGHTLINES pages, all opened
2026-10-05. Amazon picks are identified by listing title read in amazon.com search results; amazon.com pages cannot
be fetched, so each pick says which specs come from the title only. No Chevrolet roof load figure was read; the page
says so and sends readers to the owner's manual. No Thule, Yakima or GM crossbar listing naming the 2021+ Tahoe was
found on amazon.com, so those systems are described from retailer pages and are not picks.
"""

KEY = ("chevrolet", "tahoe", "2021-present", "roof-racks")

